1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,093
An outcome measure needs companion guardrails.

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:06,129
Review speed alone can reward careless routing.

3
00:00:06,199 --> 00:00:10,572
Define quality, exceptions, coverage,
and workload as appropriate.

4
00:00:10,642 --> 00:00:14,482
Keep the analysis unit consistent
and compare similar tasks.

5
00:00:14,552 --> 00:00:19,629
A small synthetic sample supports a course
decision, not a population estimate.

6
00:00:19,699 --> 00:00:25,758
Calculate improvement transparently and state
whether it represents capacity, cost, or another

7
00:00:25,828 --> 00:00:32,143
benefit. Time released becomes cash savings only
through an additional organizational mechanism.

8
00:00:32,213 --> 00:00:38,314
A change from 20 to 12 minutes is eight minutes
less per review and a 40 percent reduction in

9
00:00:38,384 --> 00:00:39,728
the sample median.

10
00:00:39,798 --> 00:00:43,723
It does not establish a 40 percent
reduction in staffing cost.

11
00:00:43,793 --> 00:00:48,167
Two wrong queues in twelve tasks would
violate the case quality threshold.

12
00:00:48,237 --> 00:00:53,015
Pause the video and complete this exercise
before opening the worked response.

13
00:00:53,085 --> 00:00:59,016
Calculate relative improvement and write one
supported claim and one claim the evidence cannot

14
00:00:59,086 --> 00:01:00,110
support.

15
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:05,748
The calculation is twenty minus twelve,
divided by twenty, which equals forty percent.

16
00:01:05,818 --> 00:01:09,829
Supported: median review time
fell in this synthetic comparison.

17
00:01:09,899 --> 00:01:12,907
Unsupported: payroll fell by forty percent.

18
00:01:12,977 --> 00:01:15,899
Add sample size and error rate to the report.

19
00:01:15,969 --> 00:01:20,300
If time falls but errors exceed the
guardrail, iterate rather than land.

20
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:23,485
What does released review
time establish directly?

21
00:01:23,555 --> 00:01:26,392
A. A guaranteed reduction in payroll B.

22
00:01:26,462 --> 00:01:28,937
Time capacity in the measured scope C.

23
00:01:29,007 --> 00:01:30,948
Universal model accuracy.

24
00:01:31,018 --> 00:01:32,490
The best answer is B.

25
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:36,720
Financial realization is a
separate claim requiring evidence.
